    "The yellow-fever quotations are present in the supplied passage, but Arm A cites a nonexistent source identifier; source-support disagreement cannot override the deterministic reference gate.",
    "The Ondol source uses tentative clay dating. The primary assessment treats loss of that qualifier as an uncertainty error; the secondary reader accepts attributed dates. Preserve this interpretive disagreement.",
    "The Venetian lazaretto source explicitly says it became a model. The primary assessment applies the preregistered corroboration rule for transmission assertions; the secondary reader accepts direct passage entailment. This is not a finding that the institutional history is false.",
    "The Nanchoc abstract locates coca leaves in house floors but does not explicitly assign the accompanying calcite that exact find context. The reviewed combined location claim remains broader than the supplied statement.",
    "The sugar textual-extension and paddy-reservoir interpretations remain sensitive to grain/qualification. Calibration does not select held-out prompts; no canonical quality label was changed merely because another model disagreed."
